  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "subject": "Contracts",
      "chapter": "Performance, Breach, and Discharge",
      "count": 61,
      "question": "A metal fabricator and manufacturer entered into a contract for the sale of a plasma cutter made by the manufacturer. While the manufacturer had several plasma cutters on hand, the contract provided for the sale of a particular plasma cutter identified by its serial number. The contract specified that the manufacturer would ship the cutter by a third-party carrier. However, the contract did not specify who was to pay the costs of transportation nor the place of tender for the plasma cutter. The manufacturer shipped the cutter identified in the contract to the fabricator via a carrier under a proper contract for its transportation. The carrier delivered the cutter to the fabricator, and the fabricator verified that the cutter delivered was the one specified in the contract.\nUnder these facts, when did the risk of loss pass to the fabricator?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "When the contract was made.",
        "B": "When the cutter was delivered to the carrier and a proper contract for its transportation was made.",
        "C": "When the cutter was unloaded on the fabricator's premises by the carrier.",
        "D": "When the fabricator verified that the cutter delivered was the cutter specified in the contract."
      },
      "answer": "B",
      "source_img": "source_imgs/q0001.png",
      "explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Explanation</title>\n  <style>\n    /* Base Reset & Typography */\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n      font-size: 1rem;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n      color: #333333;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-explanation {\n      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;\n      max-width: 900px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    /* Scroll Container for Tables */\n    .pbx-scroll-x {\n      overflow-x: auto;\n      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n\n    /* Table Styling */\n    .pbx-table {\n      min-width: 600px;\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table th, \n    .pbx-table td {\n      border: 1px solid #cccccc;\n      padding: 12px 16px;\n      vertical-align: top;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table th {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-size: 1.05rem;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      padding: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table td.pbx-col-label {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      width: 25%;\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table td.pbx-col-content {\n      width: 75%;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table .pbx-table-footer {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 0.85rem;\n      padding: 8px 16px;\n      border-top: 1px solid #cccccc;\n    }\n\n    /* Lists inside Table */\n    .pbx-table-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table-list li {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-table-list li:last-child {\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-sub-list {\n      margin-top: 4px;\n      margin-bottom: 0;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n      list-style-type: circle;\n    }\n\n    /* Main Text Elements */\n    p {\n      margin-top: 0;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      word-break: break-word;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    }\n\n    strong {\n      color: #111111;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-bullet-list {\n      margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n      list-style-type: none;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-bullet-list li {\n      position: relative;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n      padding-left: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-bullet-list li::before {\n      content: \"•\";\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      color: #333333;\n    }\n\n    /* Educational Objective */\n    .pbx-edu-objective {\n      background: #f0f7ff;\n      border-left: 4px solid #3498db;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-edu-objective-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #2980b9;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-edu-objective p {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 0.95rem;\n    }\n\n    /* References */\n    .pbx-references {\n      background: #fafafa;\n      border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-references-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #555;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n      letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    .pbx-ref-list {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding-left: 18px;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      color: #555;\n      line-height: 1.7;\n    }\n\n    /* Responsive Adjustments */\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body {\n        font-size: 0.95rem;\n        padding: 0.75rem;\n      }\n\n      .pbx-explanation {\n        padding: 0.875rem 0.5rem;\n      }\n\n      .pbx-table th, \n      .pbx-table td {\n        font-size: 0.825rem;\n        padding: 8px 10px;\n      }\n\n      .pbx-table td.pbx-col-label {\n        width: 30%;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"pbx-explanation\">\n    \n    <!-- Table Section -->\n    <div class=\"pbx-scroll-x\">\n      <table class=\"pbx-table\">\n        <thead>\n          <tr>\n            <th colspan=\"2\">\n              Risk of loss in the absence of breach<br>\n              <span style=\"font-weight: normal; font-size: 0.9rem; display: block; margin-top: 4px;\">(UCC § 2-509)</span>\n            </th>\n          </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-label\">General rule</td>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-content\">\n              <ul class=\"pbx-table-list\">\n                <li>If seller is merchant, risk of loss passes to buyer when buyer takes physical possession of goods</li>\n                <li>If not, risk of loss passes to buyer when seller satisfies contractual delivery obligations</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-label\">Goods to be shipped by carrier</td>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-content\">\n              <ul class=\"pbx-table-list\">\n                <li><strong>Shipment contract (presumed)</strong> – risk of loss passes to buyer when goods are given to carrier &amp; proper contract for shipment is made</li>\n                <li><strong>Destination contract</strong> – risk of loss passes to buyer when goods are delivered at place specified in contract</li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-label\">Goods to be held by bailee</td>\n            <td class=\"pbx-col-content\">\n              <ul class=\"pbx-table-list\">\n                <li>Risk of loss passes to buyer when:\n                  <ul class=\"pbx-sub-list\">\n                    <li>buyer receives negotiable document of title covering goods (e.g., warehouse receipt) <em>or</em></li>\n                    <li>bailee (e.g., warehouseman) acknowledges buyer's right to possess goods</li>\n                  </ul>\n                </li>\n              </ul>\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td colspan=\"2\" class=\"pbx-table-footer\">\n              <strong>UCC</strong> = Uniform Commercial Code.\n            </td>\n          </tr>\n        </tbody>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Explanation Text -->\n    <p>Contracts for the sale of goods (e.g., plasma cutter) are governed by the <strong>Uniform Commercial Code</strong> (UCC). Under the UCC, the risk of loss in the absence of a breach generally passes to the buyer when the buyer receives the goods. But if the contract requires the <strong>seller to deliver</strong> the goods through a <strong>third-party carrier</strong>, then the <strong>risk of loss passes to the buyer</strong> at different times depending on whether the contract is a:</p>\n\n    <ul class=\"pbx-bullet-list\">\n      <li><strong>shipment contract</strong> – a contract that does not require delivery at a particular location, in which case the risk of loss passes to the buyer when the <strong>goods are delivered to the carrier</strong> and a proper contract for their shipment is made <em>or</em></li>\n      <li><strong>destination contract</strong> – a contract that requires delivery at a particular location, in which case the risk of loss passes to the buyer when the <strong>goods are delivered at the named location</strong>.</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <p>Here, the contract required shipment by a third-party carrier. Because the contract did not specify a delivery location, it is presumed to be a shipment contract. Accordingly, the risk of loss shifted to the fabricator when the plasma cutter was delivered to the carrier and a proper contract for its transportation was made <span style=\"color:#9b1c1c;font-weight:600;\" data-choice=\"A C\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\">(Choices A and C)</span>.</p>\n\n    <p style=\"border-left:3px solid #c0392b; padding-left:10px;\" data-choice=\"D\" data-choice-role=\"distractor\">\n      <strong style=\"color:#9b1c1c\">(Choice D)</strong> The risk of loss remains with the seller when a tender or delivery of goods is so nonconforming that the buyer has the right to reject them. But here, the manufacturer shipped conforming goods. The fabricator did not need to first verify that the cutter delivered was the cutter specified in the contract before the risk of loss could pass to the fabricator.\n    </p>\n\n    <!-- Educational Objective -->\n    <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-edu-objective-title\">📌 Educational Objective</div>\n      <p>In a shipment contract, the risk of loss shifts to the buyer when the seller delivers the goods to a third-party carrier and makes a proper contract for their shipment.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- References -->\n    <div class=\"pbx-references\">\n      <div class=\"pbx-references-title\">📚 References</div>\n      <ul class=\"pbx-ref-list\">\n        <li>UCC § 2-509 (providing rules for risk of loss in absence of breach).</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
      "zh-question": "一家金属加工商和一家制造商签订了一份合同，约定销售由该制造商生产的一台等离子切割机。尽管制造商手头有几台等离子切割机，但合同规定销售一台通过序列号识别的特定等离子切割机。合同规定制造商将通过第三方承运人发货。然而，合同没有明确运输费用由谁支付，也没有明确等离子切割机的交货地点（place of tender）。制造商通过承运人，根据一份适当的运输合同，将合同中指定的切割机运送给了加工商。承运人将切割机交付给加工商，加工商核实所交付的切割机正是合同中指定的那一台。在这些事实下，损失风险（risk of loss）何时转移给加工商？",
      "zh-choices": {
        "A": "合同签订时。",
        "B": "切割机交付给承运人并签订了适当的运输合同时。",
        "C": "承运人将切割机卸载到加工商的场所时。",
        "D": "加工商核实所交付的切割机是合同中指定的切割机时。"
      },
      "zh-explanation": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>MBE考点解析 - Contracts</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --primary-color: #2c3e50;\n      --primary-ink: #243447;\n      --accent-color: #3498db;\n      --accent-strong: #2980b9;\n      --highlight-bg: #e8f4f8;\n      --correct-bg: #dff0d8;\n      --correct-border: #27ae60;\n      --correct-text: #1f8f4d;\n      --wrong-bg: #f8d7da;\n      --wrong-border: #f5c6cb;\n      --wrong-text: #721c24;\n      --warning-bg: #fff8e1;\n      --warning-border: #ffb300;\n      --text-color: #333333;\n      --muted-text: #666666;\n      --border-color: #dddddd;\n      --card-bg: #ffffff;\n      --bg-color: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    * { \n      box-sizing: border-box; \n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      background: var(--bg-color);\n      color: var(--text-color);\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Noto Sans SC\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n      display: block;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      width: 100%;\n      padding: 0 24px 32px;\n      background: var(--card-bg);\n    }\n\n    .header {\n      background: var(--primary-color);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 34px 24px 32px;\n      text-align: center;\n      margin-top: 20px;\n      margin-bottom: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .header h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 12px;\n      font-size: 32px;\n      line-height: 1.15;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    .sub-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      line-height: 1.35;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.92);\n    }\n\n    h2, h3 {\n      color: var(--primary-ink);\n      font-weight: 800;\n      line-height: 1.3;\n      letter-spacing: 0;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      font-size: 26px;\n      border-bottom: 3px solid var(--accent-color);\n      padding-bottom: 10px;\n      margin: 34px 0 20px;\n    }\n\n    h3 {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      margin: 28px 0 16px;\n    }\n\n    p, li {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.72;\n    }\n\n    ul, ol {\n      padding-left: 24px;\n      margin: 12px 0;\n    }\n\n    li {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    strong, b {\n      display: inline !important;\n      white-space: normal !important;\n      word-break: normal !important;\n      overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\n      font-weight: 800;\n    }\n\n    /* Component Styles */\n    .answer-box {\n      background: var(--correct-bg);\n      border-left: 6px solid var(--correct-border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 20px 24px;\n      margin: 22px 0 30px;\n      font-size: 20px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: var(--correct-text);\n    }\n\n    .concept-box {\n      background: var(--highlight-bg);\n      border-left: 6px solid var(--accent-color);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 22px 24px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n\n    .concept-box .concept-title {\n      font-size: 24px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: var(--accent-strong);\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .latin {\n      font-style: italic;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      color: #555555;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n\n    .comparison-table {\n      width: 100%;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n      font-size: 17px;\n    }\n\n    .comparison-table th {\n      background: #f8f9fa;\n      color: var(--primary-color);\n      font-weight: 800;\n      padding: 14px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .comparison-table td {\n      padding: 14px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n      vertical-align: top;\n    }\n\n    .diagram {\n      background: #ffffff;\n      border: 1px dashed #cccccc;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 22px;\n      margin: 28px 0;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .diagram-container {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-around;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 16px;\n      margin-top: 15px;\n    }\n\n    .flow-node, .party-box {\n      background: #e8fcff;\n      border: 1px solid #22b8cf;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 10px 14px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #05606a;\n      min-width: 120px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    .flow-node.active, .flow-node.highlight-node {\n      background: var(--accent-color);\n      border-color: var(--accent-color);\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n\n    .arrow {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: var(--muted-text);\n    }\n\n    .rule-block, .trap-alert, .footer-tip {\n      background: var(--warning-bg);\n      border-left: 5px solid var(--warning-border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 18px 20px;\n      margin: 24px 0;\n    }\n\n    .case-box {\n      background: var(--highlight-bg);\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 20px 22px;\n      margin: 20px 0;\n    }\n\n    .option-analysis {\n      margin-top: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .option {\n      border-radius: 8px;\n      padding: 18px 20px;\n      margin-bottom: 16px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);\n    }\n\n    .option.correct {\n      background: var(--correct-bg);\n      border-left: 5px solid var(--correct-border);\n      color: #1e5a2e;\n    }\n\n    .option.wrong {\n      background: var(--wrong-bg);\n      border-left: 5px solid var(--wrong-border);\n      color: var(--wrong-text);\n    }\n\n    .option-title {\n      font-weight: 800;\n      font-size: 19px;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n\n    code {\n      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n      padding: 2px 4px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-size: 0.92em;\n    }\n\n.term {\n        background: transparent;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(36, 52, 71, 0.26);\n        padding: 0 1px 1px;\n        border-radius: 0;\n        font-size: 1em;\n        font-weight: 800;\n        white-space: normal;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 640px) {\n      body {\n        padding: 12px;\n      }\n      .container {\n        padding: 0 12px 24px;\n      }\n      .header {\n        padding: 26px 16px;\n      }\n      .header h1 {\n        font-size: 26px;\n      }\n      .sub-title {\n        font-size: 17px;\n      }\n      body, p, li {\n        font-size: 16px;\n      }\n      .comparison-table {\n        font-size: 15px;\n        display: block;\n        overflow-x: auto;\n      }\n      .diagram-container {\n        flex-direction: column;\n        gap: 10px;\n      }\n      .arrow {\n        transform: rotate(90deg);\n        margin: 5px 0;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    \n    <!-- 【Card Top Header】 -->\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <h1>MBE 考点解析</h1>\n      <div class=\"sub-title\">Contracts: Risk of Loss in the Absence of Breach (UCC § 2-509)</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Correct Answer Box】 -->\n    <div class=\"answer-box\">\n      正确答案：B. When the cutter was delivered to the carrier and a proper contract for its transportation was made.\n      <br><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; color: #555;\">（当货物交付给承运人并签订了适当的运输合同之时，损失风险转移给买方。）</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Core Legal Rule】 -->\n    <h2>核心法律原则</h2>\n    <div class=\"concept-box\">\n      <div class=\"concept-title\">UCC § 2-509：无违约情况下的损失风险转移</div>\n      <p>在涉及货物买卖（如本案中的等离子切割机）的合同中，若双方均无违约行为，<span class=\"term\">损失风险 (Risk of Loss)</span> 的转移规则由 <strong>UCC § 2-509</strong> 管辖。当合同要求卖家通过<strong>第三方承运人 (Third-party Carrier)</strong> 运送货物时，损失风险的转移取决于该合同属于何种运输合同：</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>装运合同 (Shipment Contract)</strong>：合同不要求卖家将货物送达特定目的地。此时，一旦卖家将货物<strong>交付给承运人 (Carrier)</strong> 并为其订立了合理的运输合同，损失风险即转移给买方。</li>\n        <li><strong>目的地合同 (Destination Contract)</strong>：合同明确要求卖家将货物送达特定目的地。此时，只有当货物在<strong>指定地点完成交付 (Tender)</strong> 时，损失风险才转移给买方。</li>\n        <li><span class=\"term\">法定推定原则</span>：如果合同仅规定通过承运人运输，但<strong>未明确规定特定的送达目的地</strong>，则在法律上<strong>推定为装运合同 (Shipment Contract)</strong>。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Concept Comparison Table】 -->\n    <h2>概念对比：装运合同 vs. 目的地合同</h2>\n    <table class=\"comparison-table\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr>\n          <th>对比维度</th>\n          <th>装运合同 (Shipment Contract) <span style=\"color: var(--accent-strong);\">[法律推定]</span></th>\n          <th>目的地合同 (Destination Contract)</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>定义与特征</strong></td>\n          <td>仅要求卖家将货物交付给承运人，不强制要求送达特定地点。</td>\n          <td>明确要求卖家必须将货物运送到特定目的地（如买方营业地）。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>典型术语 (F.O.B.)</strong></td>\n          <td><code>F.O.B. Seller's Place</code> (卖家所在地交货)</td>\n          <td><code>F.O.B. Buyer's Place</code> (买家所在地交货)</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>风险转移时点</strong></td>\n          <td><strong>货物交付给承运人</strong>并订立合理运输合同之时。</td>\n          <td>货物在<strong>指定目的地</strong>妥善交付给买方之时。</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td><strong>运费与责任</strong></td>\n          <td>通常由买方承担后续运费与运输途中的损毁风险。</td>\n          <td>由卖方承担运费及运输途中的一切损毁风险。</td>\n        </tr>\n      </tbody>\n    </table>\n\n    <!-- 【Fact/Application Logic】 -->\n    <h2>案件事实与逻辑推导</h2>\n    <div class=\"case-box\">\n      <p>本案的推导步骤如下：</p>\n      <ol>\n        <li><strong>合同性质识别</strong>：买卖双方约定由第三方承运人运输等离子切割机，但合同<strong>未规定由谁支付运费</strong>，也<strong>未规定具体的交货地点 (Place of Tender)</strong>。</li>\n        <li><strong>适用法律推定</strong>：根据 UCC 规则，在合同未明确指定目的地的情况下，该合同被<strong>推定为装运合同 (Shipment Contract)</strong>。</li>\n        <li><strong>风险转移条件成就</strong>：\n          <ul>\n            <li>卖家（制造方）将合同指定的特定切割机交付给了承运人；</li>\n            <li>卖家与承运人签订了合理的运输合同 (Proper Contract)。</li>\n          </ul>\n        </li>\n        <li><strong>结论</strong>：在卖家将切割机交付给承运人并订立合理运输合同的瞬间，损失风险（Risk of Loss）就已经合法转移给了买家（金属加工方）。</li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Diagram】 -->\n    <h2>风险转移流程图</h2>\n    <div class=\"diagram\">\n      <p style=\"font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 15px; color: var(--primary-ink);\">装运合同 (Shipment Contract) 下的风险转移轨迹</p>\n      <div class=\"diagram-container\">\n        <div class=\"party-box\">卖家 (Seller)</div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">➔ (交付货物并签合同)</div>\n        <div class=\"flow-node highlight-node\">承运人 (Carrier) <br><span style=\"font-size: 12px; font-weight: normal;\">[ ⚡ 风险在此处转移给买家 ]</span></div>\n        <div class=\"arrow\">➔ (运输中)</div>\n        <div class=\"party-box\">买家 (Buyer)</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Trap Alert】 -->\n    <div class=\"trap-alert\">\n      <strong>⚠️ 易错陷阱提示：</strong>\n      <ul>\n        <li><strong>不要误认为必须“买家验货”后风险才转移</strong>：虽然买家有权在付款或接受货物前进行检验（UCC § 2-513），但“检验权”并不延缓符合合同要求的货物的损失风险转移。只要卖家交付的是完全符合合同的货物（Conforming Goods），风险在交付承运人时就已经转移。</li>\n        <li><strong>不要混淆特定物 (Identified Goods) 的影响</strong>：虽然合同指定了特定序列号的切割机，但这并不改变运输合同的风险转移规则。只要卖家交付的是该特定物，规则依然适用。</li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Answer-Choice Breakdown】 -->\n    <div class=\"option-analysis\">\n      <h2>正确答案与干扰项排除</h2>\n      \n      <div class=\"option correct\">\n        <div class=\"option-title\">B. When the cutter was delivered to the carrier and a proper contract for its transportation was made. (正确答案)</div>\n        <p>如前所述，由于合同未指定目的地，法律推定其为装运合同。卖家将符合合同的切割机交付给承运人并订立合理运输合同时，损失风险即转移给买家。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option wrong\">\n        <div class=\"option-title\">A. When the contract was made. (错误)</div>\n        <p>在涉及承运人运输的货物买卖合同中，损失风险绝不会在“合同成立时”立即转移。必须伴随实物交付或特定法定行为（如交付给承运人）才会发生转移。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option wrong\">\n        <div class=\"option-title\">C. When the cutter was unloaded on the fabricator's premises by the carrier. (错误)</div>\n        <p>该选项描述的是<strong>目的地合同 (Destination Contract)</strong> 的风险转移时点。由于本案合同未指定目的地，不能推定为目的地合同，因此风险在更早的“交付承运人”阶段就已经转移。</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"option wrong\">\n        <div class=\"option-title\">D. When the fabricator verified that the cutter delivered was the cutter specified in the contract. (错误)</div>\n        <p>买家对货物的“核对与验证”（Verification/Inspection）属于买家行使检验权的范畴。如果卖家交付的是不符合合同的货物（Nonconforming Goods），风险确实不会转移（UCC § 2-510）；但本案中卖家交付的完全是符合合同的特定切割机，因此买家事后的验证并不影响此前已经完成的风险转移。</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 【Exam Tip】 -->\n    <div class=\"footer-tip\">\n      <strong>💡 MBE 快速解题捷径：</strong>\n      <p>在 MBE 考试中，只要看到 <strong>“Seller to ship by carrier”</strong> 且 <strong>“Silent on delivery location/F.O.B.”</strong>，立刻在脑中画等号：<br>\n      <code>Silent = Shipment Contract ➔ Risk passes upon delivery to Carrier</code>。<br>\n      直接锁定“交付承运人并订立合理合同”的选项，准确率 100%，无需纠结后续的到货和验货细节！</p>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
      "meta": {
